### 创建规则（ADMIN）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "大额交易检测",
  "description": "单笔金额超过1万触发预警",
  "conditions": "{\"operator\":\"AND\",\"conditions\":[{\"field\":\"amount\",\"op\":\">\",\"value\":10000}]}",
  "actions": "{\"type\":\"create_event\",\"riskLevel\":\"high\"}",
  "priority": 10
}

### 规则列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 规则详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 更新规则
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "大额交易检测-更新",
  "description": "单笔金额超过5万触发预警",
  "conditions": "{\"operator\":\"AND\",\"conditions\":[{\"field\":\"amount\",\"op\":\">\",\"value\":50000}]}",
  "actions": "{\"type\":\"create_event\",\"riskLevel\":\"high\"}",
  "priority": 5
}

### 删除规则（无引用）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 删除规则（被引用，应返回 409）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 启用规则
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/1/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 停用规则
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rules/1/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
